          "distinct": true,
          "id": "d2a68b40252cd0e40d170786199fcc0d73a9baf9",
          "message": "[CODE HEALTH] Move simple_log_record_processor_test into anonymous namespace (#4116)\n\nWraps the 5 file-scope class and struct declarations in\nsdk/test/logs/simple_log_record_processor_test.cc within an anonymous\nnamespace to give them internal linkage, clearing the 5\nmisc-use-internal-linkage warnings clang-tidy reports on this file.\n\nThe wrap spans from the first class (TestLogRecordable) to end of file,\ncovering TestExporter, FailShutDownForceFlushExporter, EnabledCallState,\nand EnabledProcessor. TEST macros inside the namespace work correctly\nwith gtest, which registers tests via static initialization regardless\nof linkage.\n\nRatchet:\n* abiv1-preview warning_limit lowered from 376 to 371\n* abiv2-preview warning_limit lowered from 382 to 377\n\nPart of #2053\n\nSigned-off-by: thc1006 <84045975+thc1006@users.noreply.github.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-03T14:15:09-07:00",
          "tree_id": "6d1554877e1013b8385299c031e3efb61ef8bb15",
