          "id": "75c6809fc4fb2dc36b83ab3082f34b28001c05e1",
          "message": "[DOC] Fix typos in SDK header comments (#4111)\n\nFix spelling typos in comments under sdk/include (these feed the generated API docs):\n- PeriodicExportingMetricReader (periodic_exporting_metric_reader_options.h, ..._runtime_options.h)\n- Construct (attribute_utils.h, x2)\n- unnecessary layer of indirection (multi_observer_result.h)\n- async metric storage (metric_storage.h)\n\nComment-only changes; no behaviour change.\n\nFixes #4110",
