          "distinct": true,
          "id": "c3ae022b3c606e182ce74258c4868f9405685542",
          "message": "[CODE HEALTH] Move curl_http_test classes into anonymous namespace (#4115)\n\nWraps the 8 file-scope class declarations in ext/test/http/curl_http_test.cc\nwithin a single anonymous namespace to give them internal linkage. This\nclears the 8 misc-use-internal-linkage warnings clang-tidy reports on this\nfile.\n\nThe wrap spans from the first class (line 43, CustomEventHandler) through\nthe end of the file. All 8 flagged sites are covered: CustomEventHandler\nplus 5 derived event handlers, GzipEventHandler struct, BasicCurlHttpTests\nfixture, and DISABLED_BasicCurlHttpTests. The chain inheritance is\npreserved because all classes sit in the same anonymous namespace, so\nunqualified base-class lookup still resolves.\n\nTEST_F macros inside the namespace block are the recommended gtest layout:\nfixture and tests share the same anonymous namespace, the static test\nregistrar gets internal linkage, and gtest registers tests via static\ninitialization regardless of linkage.\n\nRatchet:\n* abiv1-preview warning_limit lowered from 384 to 376\n* abiv2-preview warning_limit lowered from 390 to 382\n\nPart of #2053\n\nSigned-off-by: thc1006 <84045975+thc1006@users.noreply.github.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-03T15:07:07+02:00",
