          "message": "Add preview support for bound  instruments  (#4042)\n\n* Add preview bound sync metric instruments\n\n* Fix bound instruments IWYU includes\n\n* Address bound sync instrument review feedback\n\n* Address bound instrument review feedback\n\n* Apply formatter output\n\n* Remove unused metric storage includes\n\n* Fix Windows bound instrument test build\n\n* Fix IWYU preview diagnostics\n\n* Fix ABI v2 IWYU diagnostics\n\n* Add empty attribute bound counter test\n\n* Fix bound test IWYU includes\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Doug Barker <3782873+dbarker@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Marc Alff <marc.alff@free.fr>",
