          "id": "5946e38a76cf99225886687de9d62c070532e489",
          "message": "[API] EnvironmentCarrier: normalize empty key to '_' (#4190) (#4264)\n\nFixes spec non-compliance in EnvironmentCarrier per:\nhttps://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/context/env-carriers/\n\nChanges:\n- NormalizeKey(\"\") now returns \"_\" as required by the spec:\n  'An empty environment variable name is non-normalized and\n  normalizes to _.' (spec PR opentelemetry-specification#5163)\n- Add operational guidance in class doc comment (non-normative):\n  initialization-time extraction, child process environment\n  handling, and security considerations\n- Caching behavior is retained: values are cached on first access\n  to guarantee string_view lifetime safety across threads\n  (spec PR opentelemetry-specification#5179 permits internal storage)\n\nTests added:\n- NormalizeKeyEmpty: Set(\"\", ...) writes to key \"_\" in the map\n- GetEmptyKeyNormalizesToUnderscore: Get(\"\") reads the \"_\" env var\n\nFixes #4190",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-24T11:14:35+02:00",
          "tree_id": "4162830d7ea4ba841404abb2389c11fb4f5a85e9",
          "url": "https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-cpp/commit/5946e38a76cf99225886687de9d62c070532e489"
